### Google Cloud service-account keys ###
# A service-account key is a spendable credential — an hour of an account, re-mintable forever.
# Named broadly on purpose: the mistake is rarely committing the file you meant to keep, it is
# committing the copy you made to test something.
*-sa.json
google-credentials.json
application_default_credentials.json
